          "content": "Evergreen.ai is an artificial intelligence tool offered through Evergreen Wealth Corporation. The capabilities of Evergreen.ai are evolving and may be limited by data inputs, user configuration, and system permissions. Outputs are for informational purposes only and are not a substitute for advice from a qualified, licensed professional. Do not rely on outputs from Evergreen.ai or an AI advisor as the sole basis for any financial decision. Historical returns, expected returns, and probability projections are illustrative and do not reflect actual future performance.",
